#: kio_smb_auth.cpp:144
msgid ""
"Please enter authentication information for:\n"
"Workgroup = %1\n"
"Server = %2\n"
"Share = %3"
msgstr ""
"Asseblief invoer geldigheidsverklaring informasie vir:\n"
"Werksgroep = %1\n"
"Bediener = %2\n"
"Deel = %3"

#: kio_smb_auth.cpp:221
msgid ""
"You are missing your $HOME/.smb/smb.conf file, and we could not create it.\n"
"Please manually create it to enable the smb ioslave to operate correctly.\n"
"The smb.conf file could look like: [global]    workgroup= "
"<YOUR_DEFAULT_WORKGROUP>"
msgstr ""
"Jy word kort jou $Huis/.smb/smb.conf lêer, en ons kon nie skep dit.\n"
"Asseblief eiehandig skep dit na aktiveer die smb io-slaaf na werk korrek.\n"
"die smb.conf lêer kon kyk hou van: [globale]    werksgroep= "
"<YOUR_DEFAULT_WORKGROUP>"
